    pr_ref:  # db29
    description: "In rodio, the Rust #[test] attribute creates decorated_by edges pointing to a function literally named 'test' in src/conversions/channels.rs. Every #[test]-annotated function (62+) gets an edge to this node, making it the highest-degree symbol. Same issue likely affects #[inline], #[cfg] etc. (788 decorated_by edges total). Root cause: the decorator-edge linker treats attribute names as function references."  # db29
    fields: {}  # db29
