- op: discuss  # 9243
  at: '2026-02-26T21:00:53Z'  # 9243
  by: agent  # 9243
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 9243
  clock: 3  # 9243
  nonce: '9243'  # 9243
  message: "Fixed in PR #1516. Root cause: _extract_attribute_edges resolved built-in Rust attribute names (test, cfg, inline, etc.) against global_symbols, creating false decorated_by edges when user functions had matching names. Fix: _BUILTIN_RUST_ATTRIBUTES frozenset (45 entries) skips resolution for compiler-provided and common ecosystem attribute names."  # 9243
